        {
          "label_cn": "紧握，把握；理解；领会（对知识、问题等）；控制；掌控（对人或事物的支配）；（手或能力）可及的范围",
          "label_en": "a firm hold or grip; an understanding of a subject or situation; control or power over someone or something; the range of physical reach or ability to attain something",
          "pos": "noun",
          "sense_ids": [
            "sense:grasp:cd5787114a105577",
