        }
      ],
      "core_meaning_cn": "抓牢或抓住机会、理解；抓握、理解与控制或可及范围；绝望尝试",
      "core_meaning_en": "seize or understand; a hold, understanding or control, or attainable reach; desperate attempts",
      "mental_model_cn": "grasp物体为抓牢，grasp an idea为理解，grasp an opportunity为抓住机会。名词 a grasp of 为理解，in sb’s grasp 可比喻受某人掌控；beyond one’s grasp 可指够不到或能力不及；grasp at straws表示绝望中尝试任何办法。",
      "mental_model_en": "seize or understand; a hold, understanding or control, or attainable reach; desperate attempts."
